{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":33,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["主必拯救錫安"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["你們這些毀滅別人、自己還未被毀滅的人有禍了！",{"text":"等你們毀滅完了，必毀滅你們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們這些欺詐別人、自己還未被欺詐的人有禍了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"等你們欺詐完了，必欺詐你們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，求你施恩給我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們等候你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你每天早晨都作我們的力量，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在艱難的時候拯救我們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你大喊一聲，列邦都奔逃；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你挺身而出，列國都潰散。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的戰利品必被搶光，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶如穀物被蝗蟲吃光；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人們像蝗蟲一樣撲向戰利品。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"耶和華受尊崇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為祂住在高天之上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必使錫安充滿公平和公義。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂是你一生的保障，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你得到豐盛的救恩、智慧和知識。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敬畏耶和華是你的寶藏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"看啊，他們的勇士在街上哀號，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求和的使者痛哭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大路荒涼，行人絕跡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"條約被廢，城邑被棄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人被藐視。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地枯竭衰殘，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"黎巴嫩的樹木羞慚枯乾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沙崙好像曠野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴珊和迦密的樹葉凋零。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「現在我要起來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要施展大能，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要得到尊崇。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們懷的是糠秕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"生的是碎稭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的氣息是燒滅自己的火。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列邦必被燒成灰燼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像割下的荊棘被火焚燒。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"遠方的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要聽聽我的作為。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"近處的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要承認我的大能。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"錫安的罪人恐懼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不敬虔的人顫抖。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們說：「我們誰能與烈火同住？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰能與永不止息的火焰同住？」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"秉公行義、說話正直、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"憎惡不義之財、擺手不受賄賂、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"掩耳不聽害人之謀、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"閉眼不看邪惡之事的人，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必住在高處，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的堡壘是堅固的磐石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必不會絕糧斷水。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們必目睹君王的榮美，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看到遼闊的土地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們心裡必思想以往可怕的情景，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"說：「登記的在哪裡？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"收貢銀的在哪裡？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"數城樓的在哪裡？」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們再也看不見那些殘暴之徒了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們說話深奧難解，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們講話奇怪難懂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們看我們在其中守節期的錫安城！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們必看見耶路撒冷成為安寧之地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是永不挪移的帳篷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"橛子永不拔出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"繩索也不會斷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在那裡，威嚴的耶和華必作保護我們的巨川大河。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"搖槳的小舟不能駛入，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"威嚴的戰船無法越過。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華是我們的審判官，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我們的立法者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我們的君王，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必拯救我們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敵人的帆索鬆開，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"桅桿晃動不穩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"風帆無法揚起。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時，大量戰利品將被瓜分，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"甚至瘸腿的都分得一份。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷必沒有居民說","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我生病了」，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城中百姓的罪惡必得到赦免。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/33.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/34.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/32.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":24}